<title>USA: Home Shopping consolidates center.</title>
<headline>Home Shopping consolidates center.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Home Shopping Network, a subsidiary of HSN Inc said on Wednesday that it is consolidating its Florida Returns Center with its fulfillment centers in Salem, Virginia and Waterloo, Iowa.</p>
<p>The company said that the consolidation, will be completed by April 30, 1997, affects about 250 employees, who will be given the opportunity to apply for other positions currently available in the firm's St. Petersburg headquarters.</p>
</text>
